<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background: #f1f5f9; margin: 0; padding: 40px 20px; }
    .card { background: #ffffff; border-radius: 16px; max-width: 480px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 40px; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(15,23,42,0.04), 0 4px 16px rgba(15,23,42,0.06); }
    .logo { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #3b82f6; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 28px; }
    h1 { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 12px; }
    p { font-size: 15px; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0 0 24px; }
    .btn { display: inline-block; background: #3b82f6; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 28px; border-radius: 9999px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; }
    .note { font-size: 13px; color: #94a3b8; margin-top: 28px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="logo">Messy</div>
    <h1>You've been invited to a workspace</h1>
    <p><%= @inviter.name %> invited you to <strong><%= @account.name %></strong> on Messy. Nothing has changed yet — you join only once you accept, and your existing workspaces are untouched either way.</p>
    <a href="<%= @workspace_link %>" class="btn" style="display:inline-block;background:#3b82f6;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:9999px;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;">Review invitation</a>
    <p class="note">Sign in as usual with <%= @user.email %> — the invitation is waiting in the app, so this link isn't the only way in. If you weren't expecting it, ignore this email or decline; until you accept, <%= @account.name %> can't see anything about your account.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
